  "title": {
    "zh": "圆锥曲线",
    "en": "Conic Sections"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "圆、椭圆、抛物线、双曲线看起来毫不相干，其实是同一个圆锥被不同角度的平面切出来的一家人，一个离心率 e 就能把它们连成一条线。",
    "en": "Circle, ellipse, parabola and hyperbola look unrelated, yet they are one family cut from the same cone by planes at different angles — and a single number, the eccentricity e, strings them on one line."
  },
